      "title": "QUALITY PRESETS",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### Quality & ratio\n- **0.65 MP** — fast default for 24–32 GB host-RAM boxes\n- **0.98 MP** — standard quality; needs more host RAM\n- **1.2–2.0 MP** — high/ultra quality; much slower\n\n**10 steps** is the fast default from Randy’s workflow. Raise the scheduler to **20** only when a shot needs extra prompt adherence."
      ],
      "color": "#315f7d",
      "bgcolor": "#172b3a"
    },
    {
      "id": 143,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        1340,
        690
      ],
      "size": [
        430,
        360
      ],
      "flags": {
        "collapsed": false
      },
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "HOW THIS WORKFLOW IS DIFFERENT",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "### Clean fast H3\nOfficial **pruned INT8 ConvRot** FL2VA weights + NVFP4 Qwen encoder. No DaSiWa director, no GGUF layer, no upscaler/interpolator chain.\n\n### LoRAs\nThe Power LoRA panel has three independent slots. Use LoRAs made for **MiniMax H3 FL2VA**. Start around **0.6–1.0** strength. Disabled slots add no work.\n\n### Live motion preview\nThe preview node animates 12 latent frames after every sampling step. For maximum throughput set `preview_frames` to 1; for a larger preview raise `max_resolution` from 384."
      ],
      "color": "#315f7d",
      "bgcolor": "#172b3a"
    },
